  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/714/bglog-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"658\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>Chill Craft</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">這是專為您的 Minecraft 旅程量身打造的理想整合包。不採用高難度模組，僅在純淨原版基礎上增添實用功能</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">特色：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">光影</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">遠景地平線 (Distant Horizons)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">螢幕小地圖</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">全新生態域</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">支援手把與 Steam Deck 遊玩</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">墓碑</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">背包系統</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">遠行石（快速傳送）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">搭配 Sodium 模組優化圖形效能</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/cuUaqmDFzR\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Discord 社群伺服器：&nbsp;&nbsp;https://discord.com/invite/cuUaqmDFzR</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fsaturnx%253fr%253dcca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/banner/console-affiliation-banners/banner_3274315b-0e04-45df-b19a-ffffed94e882.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:20px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
